  "facts_of_case": "Petitioner-Parag Parelkar and respondent-wife filed a marriage petition for dissolution of marital relations. The wife filed an application for interim maintenance under Section 24 of the Hindu Marriage Act, 1955. The trial court allowed the application partly.",
