      "principle": "A decree or order made by the Court under Hindu Marriage Act shall be enforced in the like manner as the decrees and orders of the Court made in the exercise of its original civil jurisdiction.",
      "held": "The Section 28-A of the Act enables the Court to pass such interim order from time to time and to make such provisions as it may deem fit in respect of custody, maintenance and education of minor children.",
